OL,3,GNEWSAFlood effects still clear in town
OL,4,Atwo years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses, community groups and
OL,7,Fcharities in the centre were all
OL,8,Funderwater and a clean-up operation
OL,9,Fimmediately swung into action but the
OL,10,Feffects of the storm left their mark on
OL,11,Fthe town.
OL,13,FThe Environment Agency has plans for
OL,14,Fthe river in the town through the
OL,15,FChippenham Avon Project which is aiming
OL,16,Fto replace an old radial gate.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
